  "verbatim_statement": "I cannot stand Elon Musk.  I like Grok.  But, how can you have a Free Speech Platform and ban people without Human Review? If I could I would totally ban xai from using any of my work.  But, that's the true nature of Free Speech and Open Source.  I despise Elon and his companies.  But, after extensive Human Review.  I'm still going to allow those dickheads to fork my stuff if they want.",
